  "value": "Each message is [sender, receiver, text]. Messages repeated for the same (sender, receiver) pair are duplicates and count once, so a receiver's score is its number of distinct senders (text is ignored). Return the receivers with the k highest scores, ties by name in code-point order (LeetCode 692 style); fewer if there are fewer receivers.",
